              "message": "Merge upstream/main into dds-changes\n\nConflicts: fidelity.rs unions the IFF mask-plane and Bc1a binary-alpha\nchecks; flat.rs keeps the compression-aware dds_image/with_alpha_channel\n(BC4 warn, BC5 GrayA) on top of upstream's #8776 alpha-channel export,\nadopting its grayscale-transparency warning and upstream's new TIFF\nstamp_flat_channels block; file-format-parity.md unions both change\nsummaries and revision rows.\n\nUpstream's new dds_writes_the_alpha_channel_as_the_texture_alpha test\nnow covers the added compressions: BC1a shares BC1's on/off threshold\nskip, BC4 warns and writes no alpha, BC5's second channel decodes as\ngreen, A8 decodes the channel itself.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>",
